
### Create a job
POST http://localhost:5035/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Senior Frontend Engineer", "company": "Monkeyjump", "location": "Remote" }

### List jobs
GET http://localhost:5035/jobs

### Get one job
GET http://localhost:5035/jobs/66c83562-70d1-447a-a725-e050c1254459

### Apply to a job
POST http://localhost:5035/jobs/66c83562-70d1-447a-a725-e050c1254459/applications
Content-Type: application/json

{ "candidateName": "Krak T" }

### List applicants for a job
GET http://localhost:5035/jobs/66c83562-70d1-447a-a725-e050c1254459/applications

### Update a job's title
PUT http://localhost:5035/jobs/a8a31f07-f346-468b-a375-6a9d75547950/title
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Staff Frontend Engineer" }